{
  "contract": "list-refetch-v1",
  "rule": "refetch = (not in_personal_detail) OR (coalesce(closed,'') != 'Y') OR (supplement_open == 'Y') OR in_capture_retry OR (detail_status_label IS NULL AND (NOT rebuild_failed_permanent OR list_label != failed_list_label)) OR (detail_status_label IS NOT NULL AND list_label != detail_status_label). Null is never compared with != directly (SQL <> and Python/Dart != disagree on null). closed/supplement_open are site values (overrides ignored).",
